OL,3,GNEWSACarer's plea to 'get on with'
OL,4,Asocial care reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FA full-time carer is calling for
OL,7,Fpoliticians to "get on with it" and
OL,8,Fsort out the social care system.
OL,10,FPaul Kemp cares for his wife Sandra,
OL,11,Fwho was diagnosed with early onset
OL,12,FAlzheimer's at the age of 52.
OL,14,FKemp, from Rochester in Kent, said he
OL,15,Fwould like to meet Prime Minister Andy
OL,16,FBurnham. "I would love for that man to
OL,17,Fcome and knock my door and sit down and
OL,18,Fhave a proper chat with me," he said.
OL,19,F"I understand he's had the same sort of
OL,20,Fconnection, so he's got a good
OL,21,Funderstanding, but we can share stories
OL,22,Fand he'd know where to go."
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
